{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12344","headline":"奉送刘相公江淮催转运 · 钱起","name":"奉送刘相公江淮催转运","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"国用资戎事，臣劳爲主忧。\n将徴任土贡，更发济川舟。\n拥传星还去，过池凤不留。\n唯高饮水节，稍浅别家愁。\n落叶淮边雨，孤山海上秋。\n遥知谢公兴，微月上江楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}